  "description": "NuExt.Presentation.Wpf provides WPF-focused presentation helpers for the NuExt ecosystem: XAML resources and styles, control and framework extensions, binding/data helpers, diagnostics, and templating utilities.\n\nCommonly used types:\nPresentation.Wpf.WindowPlacement\nPresentation.Wpf.Data.BindingProxy\nPresentation.Wpf.Data.BindingProxy`1\nPresentation.Wpf.Controls.ComboBoxExtensions\nPresentation.Wpf.Controls.ControlExtensions\nPresentation.Wpf.Controls.TreeViewItemHelper\nPresentation.Wpf.Controls.VirtualizingStackPanelExtensions\nPresentation.Wpf.Templating.ComboBoxItemTemplateSelector\nPresentation.Wpf.Diagnostics.BindingErrorTraceListener\nPresentation.Wpf.FrameworkElementExtensions\nPresentation.Wpf.DependencyObjectExtensions\nPresentation.Wpf.WindowExtensions",
